#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0252-D expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "Negative control: a conformant BDS dataset carrying NONE of the 16 concrete prohibited names and matching NONE of the 16 template-family regexes (PARAMCD, PARAM, AVAL, AVISIT and AVISITN are all legitimate BDS variables). Since Fix #270 (ruling M2-D3) the wildcard-free Check EXECUTES per variable and stays silent -> the rule's first true noViolation state (pre-#270 it could only report SKIPPED here - expand() returned empty and NoMatch dropped the rule; the recorded no-noViolation carve-out is retired for this family)."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col PARAM   type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col AVISIT  type=Char
col AVISITN type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | Albumin | 30 | WEEK2 | 2
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALB | Albumin | 31 | WEEK4 | 4
